<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in moderately heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 588.07, up 1.91.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 302 to 223.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.04.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 22,393,440 compared with 18,564,165 on Monday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
